Desktop hide by default. Since `[hidden]` has display none !important, but body.touch selector overrides with display flex when not hidden. Good.

Place bar bottom 104 on mobile; wave button top at 98, so bar sits just above. On 844 height, canvas ends ~512, wave button at 746-834, bar at bottom 104 → y ~700-740; fine.

Also when panel visible, wave button hidden via :has; place bar hidden when panel (buildType null). Fine.

Add media query? Base styles display none. `body.touch` class is set by fitCanvas at init and resize. Good.

